used by a virus \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Toothache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your tooth \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Backache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your back \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cramp\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sharp pain in a muscle\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">modals</span> like <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to give advice. <br/> You can use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>  to give some \"soft\" advice. You think its a good idea, but it is not absolutely necessary. <br/> You can use <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to give very strong advice. You think it is very important.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should get some rest.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must sleep more.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should drink this tea.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must take the medicine.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tricky", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The directions are a little tricky.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "quick ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sudden; immediate ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make a quick right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{